Summary:
  walk grows ~ O(eps_bound) = O(sqrt(p_n) log p_n / 8 pi).
  pi_calls grows ~ O(log p_n - log eps_bound) = O(log log p_n).
  Asymptotic total: O(log^2 p_n) in pi_tilde + O(sqrt(p_n) log^c p_n)
  in BPSW walk = O(sqrt(p_n) polylog) — matches Aggarwal's bound.
